<title>DENMARK: Oerestadsselkabet sets 250 mln Dkk 4 pct 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>Oerestadsselkabet sets 250 mln Dkk 4 pct 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue</p>
<p>was announced on Tuesday by arranger Den Danske Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER: OERESTADSSELSKABET I/S. AMOUNT: 250 MILLION DANISH</p>
<p>CROWNS. COUPON: FOUR PERCENT. MATURITY: NOVEMBER 15 2007.</p>
<p>LISTING: COPENHAGEN STOCK EXCHANGE. ISS DATE: JUNE 16 1997. ISS</p>
<p>PRICE: TO BE ADVISED</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
